program	errors/unsafe_mem_device_whole_struct.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	Device memory has no whole-`Regs` access — multi-register access is never atomic; project a scalar register field
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: Device memory has no whole-`Regs` access — multi-register access is never atomic; project a scalar register field"
